   <text:p text:style-name="P135" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:span text:style-name="T29">After logging in to Apple Developer, click on </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Certificates, IDs and Profiles</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29">. Press the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">All</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> selection under </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Devices</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> as shown in the illustration below and then select </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Register Multiple Devices</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29">. Then press the </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T33">Choose File</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"> button.</text:span></text:p>
