   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T10"><text:span text:style-name="T10">Click on the build number and you will be taken to a page where you can click on </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T14">Provide Export Compliance Information</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T10">. The app uses an encryption algorithm to protect the text of the app. </text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P59" loext:marker-style-name="T10"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T10"><text:span text:style-name="T10">Click </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T14">Yes</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T10"> to the first dialog that the app uses encryption and then click </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T14">Next</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T10">.</text:span></text:p>
