   <text:p text:style-name="P73" loext:marker-style-name="T44"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P7" loext:marker-style-name="T29"><text:span text:style-name="T29">The next screen will request general information about your application. The iOS bundle ID should match the Bundle ID for the app. This is the SAB Package setting from the Package Tab for the App unless a separate Bundle ID is set in the IPA Tab . The App Nickname can be set to whatever you want this app to be referenced as within Firebase. The App Store ID is the same as the Apple ID field in the SAB IPA tab described in Section 9. Once these fields are entered press “Register App”. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P70" loext:marker-style-name="T29"/>
