   <text:p text:style-name="Standard" loext:marker-style-name="T57"><text:span text:style-name="T57">At the time the key is created, a .p8 file is generated which can be used for all apps. You are allowed to make two keys through this interface, so that you can create a new key and revoke the old one, but only one is active at a time. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T57"/></text:p>
